From e742031c4c22a9d6c17d0a65aea344c7457bcf5f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WeiguangTWK <weiguangtwk@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 1 Jul 2026 08:52:36 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Neko LineageOS: Add Push Broker API [v4] and Broker
 Compatibility API [WIP]

What is Push Broker API and Broker Compatibility API:

Push Broker API aims to provide event-driven & system-level unified dispatch & health management interface, with this
API push providers (currently MiPushFramework) will no longer need to take care of background-task keeping and
screen-on listening, also health management policy in different scene (e.g. ACTIVE - screen on/STANDBY - screen off
/DORMANT - screen off & DND) to make push providers both power-saving & reliable

Broker Compatibility API [WIP] is designed to provide ability that allow non-OEM-native push providers to work norma-
-lly including device profile sproof, APK signature sproof, notification proxy etc. Also ship with permission
management UI that allow user/dev to manage capability applied to target apps

